silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_07_backend_routing_observability_sections_02_profile_preservation_concrete_anchor_4#mittensvalidationreport_0413 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensValidationReport_0413 is The validation report: a first-class olog object recording one Mittens measurement-leg result — gate status PASS, value 4.2 kg, source key valid, trace fired. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'ValidationReport', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
